# NG-RT-REFRACTION-NIGHT: the night half of NG-RT-REFRACTION.scn (design F:/aftmp/NG-RT-REFRACTION-DESIGN.md,
# «## Приёмка»). One editor session in F:/BistroFoliageProj: the bistro's shop windows by day (B16_Bistro_Street)
# and by night (GI_Bistro_Night), three frames side by side per time of day - path tracer | Translucency.Refraction
# ScreenSpace | HardwareTraced - one camera, one exposure, one time.
# The path tracer is the reference: GlobalIllumination + Reflections PathTraced (the tracer pairs them). The raster
# frames keep Reflections / GI HardwareTraced so the front layer G-buffer (Reflections.TranslucentFrontLayer,
# default 1) exists, and only Translucency.Refraction changes between _ss and _rt.
# Numbers (D11, D12): mean L over the glass area of _ss / _rt against _pt (scripts/Dev/frames_compare.py); the
# profile-dump replies (line_NNN_profile-dump.txt) after day_ss / day_rt / night_ss / night_rt: the pass
# "Translucency: Ray Traced Refraction" <= 1.0 ms at 1080p, GPU frame <= +1.2 ms over the _ss dump; [Memory] in budget.
# Frame wait: `frames N` (N presented frames). D10: turn_a -> 16 one-degree yaw steps, one frame each -> turn_b.
# The camera faces the cafe shop window Bistro_Research_Exterior_Paris_Building_01_paris_building_01_bottom_4711
# (MASTER_Glass_Exterior, StaticMeshGlass; pane pivot -108,197,-719, centre ~y 320) from 3 m out on the terrace.
# One exposure per scene: AutoExposure off (at the scene's own ManualExposureEV100), back on in the tail. The
# night half is NG-RT-REFRACTION-NIGHT.scn: a `set` dirties the scene, and Open Scene would stop at its confirm
# popup. Every capture stands >= 256 frames after the last GlobalIllumination.Method switch or camera turn (GI
# accumulation converged; else the opaque pixels drift).
# Every Quality / Anti-Aliasing override is saved to machine.json: the tail clears them.
Проект ../BistroFoliageProj/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/GI_Bistro_Night.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Anti-Aliasing "Anti-Aliasing: TAA"
Дано run Quality "Quality: Resolution.Percent 100"
# The profile-dumps carry GPU times only with GPU profiling on (Profiler "GPU"; off, every scope reads gpu 0.000).
Дано run Debug "GPU profiling: On"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position -370,300,-861
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.8806,0.07,0.4738
Дано set 6039035132485441499 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.AutoExposure false
# --- night: path tracer | ScreenSpace | HardwareTraced
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method PathTraced"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Reflections.Method PathTraced"
Когда frames 256
Тогда-вид night_pt night, path tracer: the reference - the interior lamps behind the glass, the second glass / bottles behind the window
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method HardwareTraced"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Reflections.Method HardwareTraced"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Translucency.Refraction ScreenSpace"
Когда frames 256
Когда profile-dump
Тогда-вид night_ss night, ScreenSpace: differences D1-D9 against night_pt recorded (D11) - mean L error of the glass area vs night_pt, the second glass / water behind the window missing or not (D5)
